! LO companion of ggxy_ggZH_ZToLL_13p6TeV: the same card with bornonly 1 and LOevents 1 (Born
! kinematics only, no POWHEG emission; shower with Pythia8 without the POWHEG veto).
! CMS gridpack card for POWHEG-BOX-V2/ggxy_ggZH: gg -> Z(l+l-)H at NLO QCD + PS
! (ggxy two-loop amplitudes, Recola one-loop Born and reals; arXiv:2603.15762, CPC 320 (2026) 109933).
! Physics settings of the process authors' testrun card (mu_R = mu_F = m_ZH/2, on-shell top mass,
! hdamp 250, extZ 1); CMS Run-3 conventions for the rest (13.6 TeV, NNPDF31_nnlo_as_0118_mc_hessian_pdfas
! 325300, vdecaymode 11 = e/mu/tau, undecayed Higgs).  The two-loop amplitudes are expanded in the
! external masses: m_ll and m_H must stay below 150 GeV, hence max_z_mass 150.  Hadronic Z decays are
! not available.  NEVENTS and SEED are set by runcmsgrid.sh.
! ggZH production parameters:
Zmass 91.1876
Zwidth 2.4955
Hmass 125.0
topmass 172.5
Wmass 80.385
min_z_mass     15d0
max_z_mass    150d0
onshellhiggs 1
Hwidth 4.07d-3
min_h_mass    15d0
max_h_mass   150d0
vdecaymode  11
hdecaymode -1
chzz      1.0
extZ 1
mtscheme          0
mtscale           1
mutscfact         1d0
crd_runLoops_as   5
crd_runLoops_mt   5
crd_convLoops_mt  4
crd_as5mz         0.118d0
crd_mz            91.1876d0
! general parameters:
numevts NEVENTS
ih1         1
ih2         1
ebeam1 6800d0
ebeam2 6800d0
lhans1 325300
lhans2 325300
use-old-grid    1
use-old-ubound  1
ncall1  20000
itmx1       3
ncall2  40000
itmx2       2
foldcsi     1
foldy       1
foldphi     1
nubound 20000
! scale settings: process default mu_R = mu_F = m_ZH/2 (fixedscale 0)
facscfact   1d0
renscfact   1d0
alphas_from_pdf 1
! Born, plots and powheg strategy:
LOevents          1
bornonly          1
testplots         1
fastbtlbound      1
storemintupb      1
ubexcess_correct  1
storeinfo_rwgt    1
withnegweights    1
hdamp           250
iseed SEED
manyseeds 1
parallelstage 1
xgriditeration 1
maxseeds 1000
check_bad_st1 1
check_bad_st2 1
